        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Thewlis, Patty Jenkins, Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, Jason Fuchs, Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, Connie Nielsen, Elena Anaya, Jeffrey Donovan\n- Works: James and the Giant Peach, The Miracle Maker, Anomalisa, Fargo, Wonder Woman\n- Organizations: FX\n\nFacts:\n- David Thewlis did voice work in the films James and the Giant Peach (1996), The Miracle Maker (2000), and Anomalisa (2015).\n- Fargo premiered on FX on April 15, 2014.\n- Fargo uses an anthology format, with each season set in a different era and featuring a different story with mostly new characters and cast, although there is minor overlap.\n- Wonder Woman is directed by Patty Jenkins and has a screenplay by Allan Heinberg from a story by Allan Heinberg, Zack Snyder, and Jason Fuchs.\n- Wonder Woman stars Gal Gadot, Chris Pine, Robin Wright, Danny Huston, David Thewlis, Connie Nielsen, and Elena Anaya.\n- Jeffrey Donovan had a recurring role in the second season of Fargo in 2015.",
